    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i ever cared about is just... crumbling. it feels like i'm just standing here watching the world go dark bit by bit and there is literally nothing i can do to stop it. id like to think things get better but they dont. they just get worse until there is nothing left. what's even the point of sticking around to see the end of it all?",
